  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Scene1Intro
  tvNewsLines:
  - speakerName: '[TV - NEWS]'
    text: Good morning! Starting today, oil companies are implementing another major
      oil price hike nationwide.
  - speakerName: '[TV - NEWS]'
    text: Diesel prices have jumped by nearly three pesos per liter, marking the
      fifth straight week of increases this month.
  - speakerName: '[TV - NEWS]'
    text: Jeepney drivers and everyday commuters are feeling the heavy impact as
      basic goods continue to get more expensive.
  - speakerName: JEFF
    text: Sigh... diesel went up again. I better be active and hit the road early.
